  {
   "id": 646800,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>Clare is deriving the quadratic formula by solving <span data-math=\"ax^2+bx+c=0\">ax^2+bx+c=0</span> by completing the square.<br><br>\nShe arrived at this equation: <span data-math=\"(2ax+b)^2=b^2−4ac\">(2ax+b)^2=b^2−4ac</span>.<br><br>\nChoose the best description of what she needs to do to finish solving for <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>.</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1273405,
     "content_html": "Find the square roots of each side. Divide each side by 2. Subtract <span data-math=\"b\">b</span> from each side."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273406,
     "content_html": "Divide each side by 2. Subtract <span data-math=\"b\">b</span> from each side. Then find the square roots of each side."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273407,
     "content_html": "Find the square roots of each side. Subtract <span data-math=\"b\">b</span> from each side. Then divide each side by <span data-math=\"2a\">2a</span>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273408,
     "content_html": "Subtract <span data-math=\"b^2\">b^2</span> from each side. Find the square roots of each side. Then divide each side by 2."
    }
   ],
